---
title: "Remove API Keys From Logs and Code: Free Tool"
description: "Remove API keys, tokens, passwords, private keys and internal hostnames from logs, config files and code before you share them. Runs in your browser."
---

<section class="tool-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <%= partial "partials/brand" %>
    <h1>Secrets Scrubber</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Paste logs, config files or code and get a copy without keys, tokens and passwords.
      Detection runs on your device. Your text is never uploaded.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="tool">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="controls">
      <div class="control">
        <span class="control-label">Hide</span>
        <div class="chips" id="categories"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="control-row">
        <label class="control">
          <span class="control-label">Replace with</span>
          <select id="style">
            <option value="labels">Labels: [API_KEY]</option>
            <option value="numbered">Numbered labels: [API_KEY_1]</option>
            <option value="blocks">Blocks: ████</option>
            <option value="redacted">[REDACTED]</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label class="control grow">
          <span class="control-label">Always hide these words</span>
          <input type="text" id="custom" placeholder="acme-prod, billing.example.com" autocomplete="off">
        </label>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="panes">
      <div class="pane">
        <div class="pane-head">
          <span>Original</span>
          <span class="pane-actions">
            <button type="button" id="example" class="text-button">Paste an example</button>
            <button type="button" id="clear" class="text-button">Clear</button>
          </span>
        </div>
        <textarea id="input" spellcheck="false" placeholder="Paste logs, a config file or code here…" aria-label="Original text"></textarea>
      </div>

      <div class="pane">
        <div class="pane-head">
          <span>Scrubbed</span>
          <span id="count" class="pane-meta"></span>
        </div>
        <div id="output" class="output is-empty" aria-live="polite" data-placeholder="The scrubbed text shows here. Click a redaction to keep the original."></div>
        <div class="pane-foot">
          <button type="button" id="copy" class="button">Copy</button>
          <button type="button" id="download" class="button button-outline">Download .txt</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="notes">
      <div>
        <h3>Private by design</h3>
        <p>The page has no server code and uses no AI model. Pattern rules find more than 25 key and token formats, such as AWS, Stripe, GitHub, Slack, Google, OpenAI and Anthropic keys, JWTs and private keys.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Check before you share</h3>
        <p>Pattern rules cannot know every secret format. Read the result. Add your own project names or hosts to "Always hide these words".</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Rotate leaked keys</h3>
        <p>If a key was already shared, for example in a ticket or a chat, removing it from the text is not enough. Revoke the key and make a new one.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script type="module" src="/javascripts/tools/secrets-scrubber.js"></script>
